{"seq":2,"slug":"dom-cost","title":"长列表 DOM 之痛：贵在哪四处","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtual-scrolling/foundations/dom-cost","wordCount":1512,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"长列表-dom-之痛-贵在哪四处\">长列表 DOM 之痛：贵在哪四处</h1><p>「长列表卡」是一句直觉，但要决定该不该虚拟化，得把这句直觉换成账单。一个 DOM 节点从来不是「一小块 HTML」，它在浏览器里同时存在于四个不同的子系统：内存中的对象树、布局引擎的盒子、绘制层的位图、以及 JavaScript 堆里被引用的对象。列表越长，这四处的开销各自以不同的方式累积，而它们中的任何一个吃满，滚动就会掉帧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>浏览器把一次页面更新拆成一条流水线：解析 DOM 与 CSSOM、构建渲染树、布局（layout / reflow）、绘制（paint）、合成（composite）。列表项数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 会同时推高其中多个环节。粗略地，一次全量布局的代价随参与布局的节点数近似线性增长，可以写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{layout} \\approx c \\cdot N_{visible\\_in\\_layout}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ib</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；朴素渲染让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{visible\\_in\\_layout} = N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ib</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，虚拟化让它降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>下图把「一项数据」到「四类成本」的映射画出来，这也是理解虚拟化为何有效的反面——它正是靠砍掉左侧的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 来削减右侧全部四项。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[N 条列表项] --&gt; B[内存: 每项数十个节点对象&lt;br/&gt;+ 样式/布局对象]&#10;  A --&gt; C[布局: 参与 reflow 的盒子数&lt;br/&gt;随 N 线性增长]&#10;  A --&gt; D[绘制/合成: 图层与位图&lt;br/&gt;随可绘制区域增长]&#10;  A --&gt; E[GC: 增删节点产生的&lt;br/&gt;短命对象与回收压力]&#10;  B --&gt; F[主线程每帧预算 ~16.7ms 被吃满]&#10;  C --&gt; F&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[滚动掉帧/输入延迟]\">flowchart TD\n  A[N 条列表项] --&gt; B[内存: 每项数十个节点对象&lt;br/&gt;+ 样式/布局对象]\n  A --&gt; C[布局: 参与 reflow 的盒子数&lt;br/&gt;随 N 线性增长]\n  A --&gt; D[绘制/合成: 图层与位图&lt;br/&gt;随可绘制区域增长]\n  A --&gt; E[GC: 增删节点产生的&lt;br/&gt;短命对象与回收压力]\n  B --&gt; F[主线程每帧预算 ~16.7ms 被吃满]\n  C --&gt; F\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[滚动掉帧/输入延迟]</pre><p>四类成本的性质和触发时机并不相同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本类别</th>\n<th>主要触发点</th>\n<th>随什么增长</th>\n<th>症状</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内存</td>\n<td>节点创建时</td>\n<td>节点总数 × 单项节点复杂度</td>\n<td>页面驻留内存高、标签页被系统回收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布局 (reflow)</td>\n<td>插入/删除/尺寸变化</td>\n<td>参与布局的节点数</td>\n<td>首屏慢、增删项时长卡顿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绘制/合成</td>\n<td>内容或位置变化</td>\n<td>需重绘的像素面积、图层数</td>\n<td>滚动时掉帧、GPU 内存吃紧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>垃圾回收</td>\n<td>大量短命对象产生后</td>\n<td>增删节点频率</td>\n<td>周期性卡顿（GC 停顿）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"内存-一项远不止一个节点\">内存：一项远不止一个节点</h2><p>一条看似简单的列表项——头像、昵称、正文、时间、几个操作按钮——展开成 DOM 往往是几十个元素节点，每个节点还挂着计算后的样式对象、布局盒对象、以及可能的事件监听器。假设单项平均 40 个节点，一万项就是四十万个节点对象。节点对象本身、加上样式与布局元数据，在主流引擎里每个节点几百字节到上千字节不等，累加起来轻松到几百 MB。这还没算你为每项绑定的 JS 数据和闭包。内存吃紧的直接后果是：移动端标签页被系统在后台回收、桌面端页面整体变慢、以及下面要说的 GC 压力。虚拟化把 DOM 侧的这部分从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，是它最立竿见影的收益之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"布局-reflow-是随节点数线性的\">布局：reflow 是随节点数线性的</h2><p>布局是浏览器根据盒模型计算每个元素几何位置的过程。它的代价与参与计算的节点数强相关，而且有个放大器叫「布局抖动」（layout thrashing）：如果你在一次 JS 执行里交替地写样式、读几何（如 <code>offsetHeight</code>），浏览器会被迫反复同步重排。长列表里这尤其危险——朴素方案一次性插入一万项，触发的是一次覆盖全部节点的巨型 reflow，首屏白屏就来自这里。布局的机制细节（回流的传播范围、哪些属性会触发同步布局）属于 <a href=\"../../browser-rendering-internals/pipeline/layout-reflow\">布局与回流</a>，本篇只强调结论：让参与布局的节点数保持在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，是虚拟化省下首屏时间的核心原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"绘制-合成与滚动帧预算\">绘制、合成与滚动帧预算</h2><p>节点进入布局后还要被绘制成位图，再由合成器把各图层拼到屏幕上。绘制成本与需要重绘的像素面积、以及图层数量相关；滚动时，如果内容不能被提升为可独立合成的图层，浏览器可能需要在每一帧重绘大片区域。浏览器要维持 60fps，意味着每帧只有约 16.7ms 的主线程预算——布局、绘制、加上你自己的 <code>scroll</code> 事件处理都得挤进去。节点越多，单帧越容易超支，表现就是滚动掉帧和输入延迟。绘制与合成的分层机制见 <a href=\"../../browser-rendering-internals/pipeline/paint\">绘制</a> 与 <a href=\"../../browser-rendering-internals/pipeline/compositing\">合成</a>；帧预算与主线程占用的量化见 <a href=\"../../web-performance-vitals/runtime/js-main-thread\">JS 与主线程</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"垃圾回收-增删节点的隐形税\">垃圾回收：增删节点的隐形税</h2><p>前三类成本是「存量」，GC 则是「流量」带来的。无限滚动或朴素的「滚到哪加载到哪」会不断创建节点；而某些实现又会在离场时销毁节点。频繁的创建—销毁会在 JS 堆里产生大量短命对象，触发更频繁的垃圾回收，而 GC 是会 stop-the-world 的——它带来的是周期性、难以复现的卡顿，往往在性能面板上表现为规律出现的长任务尖峰。这也解释了为什么下一层的优化不是「删了重建」而是<strong>节点回收复用</strong>：复用固定一批节点、只改内容，能把 GC 流量压到最低（详见 <a href=\"../techniques/node-recycling\">节点回收与池化</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>一个 DOM 节点同时消耗内存、布局、绘制/合成、GC 四类资源，长列表让它们各自沿不同曲线累积。</li>\n<li>布局代价随参与节点数近似线性，朴素方案的巨型 reflow 是首屏白屏的元凶。</li>\n<li>60fps 意味着每帧约 16.7ms 主线程预算，节点越多越容易超支导致滚动掉帧。</li>\n<li>频繁增删节点带来 GC 压力，这是「回收复用而非删了重建」的直接动因。</li>\n<li>虚拟化通过把「参与渲染的节点数」钉在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，同时削减这四类成本——这就是它有效的机制解释。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>兄弟篇：<a href=\"why-virtual-scrolling\">为何虚拟滚动</a> — 本篇量化的成本，正是它省下的东西。</li>\n<li>兄弟篇：<a href=\"../techniques/node-recycling\">节点回收与池化</a> — 针对 GC 与布局成本的工程对策。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../browser-rendering-internals/pipeline/layout-reflow\">布局与回流</a> — reflow 传播与同步布局的机制。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../web-performance-vitals/runtime/js-main-thread\">JS 与主线程</a> — 帧预算与长任务的量化视角。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"长列表 DOM 之痛：贵在哪四处","id":"长列表-dom-之痛-贵在哪四处"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"内存：一项远不止一个节点","id":"内存-一项远不止一个节点"},{"level":2,"text":"布局：reflow 是随节点数线性的","id":"布局-reflow-是随节点数线性的"},{"level":2,"text":"绘制、合成与滚动帧预算","id":"绘制-合成与滚动帧预算"},{"level":2,"text":"垃圾回收：增删节点的隐形税","id":"垃圾回收-增删节点的隐形税"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"为何虚拟滚动：只渲染看得见的那一屏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtual-scrolling/foundations/why-virtual-scrolling"},"next":{"title":"虚拟滚动、分页与无限滚动：三种应对长列表的取舍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtual-scrolling/foundations/virtual-vs-pagination"}}